OL,3,GNEWSAPrisoner jailed over sex messages
OL,4,Ato 13-year-old
OL,5,
OL,6,FA paedophile who sent sexualised
OL,7,Fmessages to a 13-year-old girl from a
OL,8,Fprison has been jailed for three years.
OL,10,FMartin Mills, 38, was using a mobile
OL,11,Fphone which had been sneaked into North
OL,12,FSea Camp Open Prison at Freiston, near
OL,13,FBoston, Lincolnshire.
OL,15,FA statement from the victim's mother
OL,16,Fsaid her daughter had self-harmed and
OL,17,Fneeded counselling after Mills'
OL,18,Fmessages "lured her to very dark
OL,19,Fplaces".
